# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MASTER CURSOR AI RULES & BLUEPRINT FOR MULTI-TENANT BPO/ERP SYSTEM
# Tech Stack: Next.js 15 (App Router), TypeScript, Supabase (PostgreSQL + RLS),
# Tailwind CSS, Shadcn UI, Vercel AI SDK
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

---
description: Complete Master Rules & Blueprint for ERP Multi-tenant (PM Assignment + Employee Assignment + Client 1-to-Many Projects + HRIS BPO + Lead Finance + Dynamic Approval + Cash Advance + Petty Cash + Overtime/Leave + PM Handover + Operations Hierarchy)
globs: **/*
alwaysApply: true
---

# 1. GENERAL ARCHITECTURE & CODE STANDARDS
- Framework: Next.js 15 dengan App Router dan React Server Components (RSC) secara default.
- Gunakan `'use client'` HANYA pada komponen UI interaktif yang membutuhkan Client Hooks / State.
- Type Safety: Wajib menggunakan TypeScript ketat dan validasi Zod Schema pada semua Server Actions dan API Routes.
- Kode Utuh: DILARANG menuliskan placeholder seperti `// TODO: implement this`. Selalu hasilkan kode fungsional yang siap pakai.
- Security: DILARANG keras menyimpan API Key atau credentials secara hardcode. Gunakan `.env.local`.

# 2. MULTI-TENANCY RULES (CRITICAL)
- Single Database, Shared Schema dengan Discriminator `tenant_id UUID REFERENCES tenants(id) NOT NULL` di SETIAP tabel (kecuali global lookup).
- Row Level Security (RLS) Supabase WAJIB diaktifkan di seluruh tabel.
- Policy RLS wajib memverifikasi `tenant_id` pengakses melalui JWT Claim (`auth.jwt() -> 'tenant_id'`).
- Middleware (`middleware.ts`) wajib mendeteksi `tenant_slug` dari URL/Subdomain dan mengecek auth session.
- AI Analytics DILARANG KERAS membaca, memproses, atau membocorkan data lintas `tenant_id`.

# 3. ORGANIZATIONAL HIERARCHY & ROLES MANAGEMENT
Aplikasi ini menerapkan hirarki kepemimpinan bertingkat untuk bisnis BPO/Managed Services:
- **Employee**: Staf/Agent/Tim Proyek. Menjalankan operasional, mengajukan `project_expenses`, `cash_advances`, klaim `petty_cash`, serta `hr_requests` (lembur/cuti/sakit).
- **Supervisor**: Atasan langsung Employee di tingkat operasional/team lead.
- **Project Manager (PM)**: Penanggung jawab proyek. 1 PM dapat di-assign mengelola >1 proyek sekaligus. PM melapor ke 1 Operations Manager.
- **Operations Manager / Lead PM (OM)**: Membawahi & mengontrol **lebih dari 1 PM** beserta seluruh proyeknya. OM melapor ke Head Manager.
- **Head Manager (HM)**: Membawahi beberapa Operations Manager (OM). HM melapor ke General Manager.
- **General Manager (GM)**: Pengawas operasional tertinggi sebelum C-Level / Tenant Admin.
- **Petty Cash Custodian**: Admin Ops / Admin Cabang yang memegang & mengelola fisik kas kecil untuk pengeluaran minor rutin.
- **Lead Finance / Finance Manager**: Gatekeeper Keuangan. Memverifikasi kepatuhan anggaran, pencairan Cash Advance, approval replenishment Petty Cash, verifikasi Settlement nota/struk, payroll release, dan invoice BPO.
- **HR Admin**: Mengelola master data HRIS, approval final cuti/sakit, dan integrasi roster/payroll.

Struktur Atasan (Reporting Line) di Database:
- Tabel `employees` wajib memiliki `reports_to_employee_id UUID REFERENCES employees(id)` untuk merepresentasikan rantai komando.

# 4. RESOURCE ASSIGNMENT ENGINE (PM & EMPLOYEE ASSIGNMENTS)
Sistem ini memisahkan penetapan alokasi sumber daya manusia ke dalam dua level:

1. **PM Assignment (`project_pm_assignments`)**:
   - Menghubungkan PM ke proyek (`project_id`, `pm_employee_id`, `assignment_role` ['PRIMARY_PM'|'CO_PM'], `start_date`, `end_date`, `status`).
   - Ditentukan/di-assign oleh Operations Manager (OM) atau Head Manager (HM).
   - PM HANYA memiliki akses kontrol dan approval pada proyek-proyek tempat mereka memiliki status assignment `ACTIVE`.

2. **Employee Assignment (`project_employee_assignments`)**:
   - Menghubungkan Karyawan ke proyek (`project_id`, `employee_id`, `assigned_role_in_project`, `allocation_percentage` [e.g. 50% / 100%], `start_date`, `end_date`, `status`).
   - Ditentukan/di-assign oleh PM Proyek atau Operations Manager.
   - **Validasi Alokasi**: Total `allocation_percentage` seorang karyawan di seluruh proyek aktif DILARANG melebihi 100% kecuali ada pengajuan lembur/overtime resmi.
   - **Integrasi**: Karyawan yang berstatus `ACTIVE` assigned pada suatu proyek dapat dimasukkan ke dalam `employee_rosters` shift, ditugaskan pada `tasks`, dan mencatatkan jam kerja di `timesheets`.

# 5. CLIENT / CUSTOMER MANAGEMENT (1 CLIENT TO MANY PROJECTS)
Setiap akun Klien/Customer dikelola melalui tabel `clients`:
- **Relasi 1-to-Many**: Satu `client` dapat memiliki **lebih dari satu proyek** (`projects.client_id REFERENCES clients(id)`).
- **Master Data Client**: Menyimpan info kontak utama (`company_name`, `client_code`, `contact_person`, `email`, `phone`, `industry`, `status`).
- **Agregasi Dashboard Client**: Sistem wajib menyediakan tampilan ringkasan per Klien yang mengagregasikan seluruh proyek aktif, alokasi PM & Employee, total anggaran/pemasukan, performa SLA kumulatif, dan profitabilitas (Gross Margin) lintas proyek dari Klien tersebut.

# 6. VALUE-BASED DYNAMIC APPROVAL & DUAL-KEY FINANCE ENGINE
Pengajuan anggaran proyek (`project_expenses`) dan Kas Bon (`cash_advances`) dimulai dari **Employee** dan diteruskan berdasarkan **Nominal Anggaran (Threshold Matrix)**:

Rantai Approval Lengkap:
1. **Level 1**: Supervisor (Validasi kebutuhan operasional lapangan).
2. **Level 2**: Project Manager (Validasi lingkup & relevansi proyek).
3. **Level 2.5 / Parallel Gate**: **Lead Finance** (Validasi ketersediaan cashflow, kelengkapan bukti/nota, dan efisiensi anggaran).
4. **Level 3**: Operations Manager / Lead PM (OM - Atasan PM).
5. **Level 4**: Head Manager (HM).
6. **Level 5**: General Manager (GM) / C-Level.

Aturan Threshold Nominal Anggaran:
- **Nilai Kecil (< Rp 5.000.000)**: Cukup sampai **Level 2 (PM) + Verification Lead Finance**.
- **Nilai Sedang (Rp 5.000.000 - Rp 25.000.000)**: Wajib lanjut ke **Level 3 (OM) + Lead Finance**.
- **Nilai Besar (Rp 25.000.000 - Rp 100.000.000)**: Wajib lanjut ke **Level 4 (HM) + Lead Finance**.
- **Nilai Sangat Besar (> Rp 100.000.000)**: Wajib sampai **Level 5 (GM / C-Level) + Lead Finance**.

# 7. PETTY CASH MODULE (KAS KECIL OPERASIONAL)
Setiap akun Kas Kecil dikelola menggunakan metode *Imprest Fund System*:
1. **Pengelolaan Akun Kas Kecil (`petty_cash_funds`)**: Dibuat per lokasi/proyek dengan menentukan `custodian_employee_id`, `max_limit_amount`, dan `min_threshold_amount`.
2. **Pencatatan Voucher Kas Kecil (`petty_cash_vouchers`)**: Untuk pengeluaran operasional minor (< Rp 1.000.000). Wajib melampirkan `receipt_url`.
3. **Pengisian Kembali Kas Kecil (`petty_cash_replenishments`)**: Saat saldo mendekati threshold, Custodian mengajukan Replenishment ke Lead Finance. After approval, dana ditransfer dan `project_budgets` terpotong resmi.

# 8. CASH ADVANCE & SETTLEMENT MODULE (UANG MUKA KERJA)
Setiap pengajuan Uang Muka Kerja dikelola melalui tabel `cash_advances` dan `cash_advance_settlements`:
1. **Request Phase**: Pemohon mengajukan `amount_requested`, `purpose`, dan `project_id`. Mengikuti alur Dynamic Approval sampai dana disetujui & dicairkan oleh Lead Finance (`DISBURSED`).
2. **Settlement Phase**: Setelah kegiatan selesai, Pemohon wajib mengisi form Settlement dan mengunggah rincian nota/struk (`actual_amount_spent`, `receipt_urls`).
3. **Balance Clearance**:
   - Jika `actual_amount_spent` < `amount_requested`: Pemohon mengembalikan sisa uang (*Refund*).
   - Jika `actual_amount_spent` > `amount_requested`: Lead Finance mencairkan selisih kekurangan (*Reimbursement Top-up*).
   - Saldo `project_budgets.spent_amount` resmi dipotong sebesar `actual_amount_spent` setelah Settlement berstatus `SETTLED`.
4. Pemohon TIDAK BISA mengajukan Cash Advance baru jika masih memiliki Cash Advance sebelumnya yang berstatus `DISBURSED` (belum di-Settlement).

# 9. HRIS MODULE: OVERTIME, LEAVE & SICK REQUESTS
Setiap pengajuan Form HR dikelola melalui tabel `hr_requests`:
- **Cuti (Leave) & Lembur (Overtime)**: Alur approval berjenjang **Employee Submit -> Supervisor (L1) -> PM (L2) -> Operations Manager (L3) -> HR Admin (Final)**.
- **Sakit (Sick Leave)**: Wajib melampirkan *attachment_url* (Surat Dokter). Approval oleh **Supervisor (L1) -> HR Admin (Final)**.

Integrasi HRIS ke Operasional BPO:
- Jika **Overtime** disetujui: Jam lembur otomatis menambah kalkulasi Direct Labor Cost pada `project_budgets` proyek BPO yang bersangkutan dan masuk ke komponen Payroll.
- Jika **Cuti/Sakit** disetujui: Status jadwal di `employee_rosters` otomatis berubah menjadi `LEAVE`/`SICK`. AI Analytics akan memberikan peringatan jika shift BPO kekurangan kuota agent.

# 10. PM HANDOVER ENGINE (TRANSISI & SERAH TERIMA PROYEK)
Proses serah terima tanggung jawab dari PM Lama (*Outgoing PM*) ke PM Baru (*Incoming PM*) dikelola melalui tabel `pm_handovers`:
1. Inisiasi oleh Outgoing PM atau Operations Manager (OM) dengan menentukan `project_id`, `from_pm_id`, `to_pm_id`, `reason`, dan `effective_date`.
2. Approval Handover wajib disetujui oleh **Operations Manager (OM)** dan **Head Manager (HM)**.
3. **Eksekusi Otomatis Transactional di Database**:
   - Memperbarui status record di `project_pm_assignments` (`from_pm_id` -> INACTIVE, `to_pm_id` -> ACTIVE).
   - Mengalihkan (*re-assign*) semua *pending approval expenses*, *pending cash advances*, dan *pending petty cash vouchers* proyek tersebut di level PM ke `to_pm_id`.
   - Mengalihkan seluruh *tasks* aktif milik proyek tersebut ke `to_pm_id`.
   - Mencatat Audit Log lengkap sisa budget, insiden SLA, dan riwayat dokumen ke `pm_handover_logs`.

# 11. BPO & MANAGED SERVICES BUSINESS RULES
- Setiap proyek BPO terikat pada `clients` dan `bpo_contracts` (Monthly Recurring Revenue) serta `sla_commitments` (MTTR, Uptime, Penalty Rates).
- HRIS wajib mendukung Scheduling Shift (Pagi/Siang/Malam di `work_shifts` & `employee_rosters`), Tunjangan Shift, dan Lembur.
- Direct Labor Cost proyek BPO dihitung otomatis: `(Jam Kerja Timesheet * Hourly Rate) + Tunjangan Shift + Biaya Lembur Approved`.
- Real-Time Gross Margin Kontrak BPO = `Monthly Revenue - (Direct Labor Cost + Operational Expenses + Petty Cash Expenses + SLA Penalties)`.
- Lead Finance mengelola konversi data operasional ini menjadi **Invoice Penagihan Bulanan** ke Klien BPO.

# 12. ISOLATED AI ANALYTICS ENGINE
Menggunakan Vercel AI SDK dengan Structured Outputs (`generateObject` + Zod).
AI Engine menyediakan:
1. `predict-expense-impact`: Menganalisis nominal biaya/Cash Advance/Kas Kecil yang diajukan terhadap sisa budget dan gross margin proyek sebelum approver & Lead Finance menekan tombol Approve.
2. `analyze-resource-utilization`: Menganalisis tingkat alokasi PM dan Karyawan di seluruh proyek untuk mendeteksi *under-utilized* atau *over-allocation* (utilisasi > 100%).
3. `analyze-pm-capacity & handover-readiness`: Menganalisis beban kerja PM yang mengelola banyak proyek serta menguji kesiapan PM Baru saat menerima Handover Proyek.
4. `analyze-client-health`: Menganalisis tingkat kepuasan dan risiko kerugian dari portofolio proyek milik Klien (*Client Lifetime Value & Churn Risk*).
5. `analyze-sla-breach`: Memprediksi potensi pelanggaran SLA BPO dalam 24-48 jam berdasarkan alokasi roster shift, pengajuan cuti/sakit, vs volume tiket.

# 13. DATABASE SCHEMA BLUEPRINT (REFERENCE SQL)
Gunakan struktur skema tabel berikut sebagai acuan pembuatan file migration SQL:
- `tenants` (id, name, slug, plan, status)
- `users` (id, auth_user_id, tenant_id, role ['TENANT_ADMIN'|'GM'|'HEAD_MANAGER'|'OPERATIONS_MANAGER'|'PROJECT_MANAGER'|'LEAD_FINANCE'|'SUPERVISOR'|'EMPLOYEE'|'HR_ADMIN'|'PETTY_CASH_CUSTODIAN'])
- `employees` (id, tenant_id, user_id, full_name, role, reports_to_employee_id NULLABLE REFERENCES employees(id), hourly_rate, status)
- `clients` (id, tenant_id, company_name, client_code, contact_person, email, phone, industry, status)
- `bpo_contracts` (id, tenant_id, client_id REFERENCES clients(id), contract_number, monthly_recurring_revenue, start_date, end_date)
- `sla_commitments` (id, tenant_id, contract_id REFERENCES bpo_contracts(id), metric_name, target_value, penalty_rate_per_breach)
- `projects` (id, tenant_id, client_id REFERENCES clients(id), contract_id NULLABLE REFERENCES bpo_contracts(id), name, budget, status)
- `project_pm_assignments` (id, tenant_id, project_id REFERENCES projects(id), pm_employee_id REFERENCES employees(id), assignment_role ['PRIMARY_PM'|'CO_PM'], start_date, end_date NULLABLE, status ['ACTIVE'|'INACTIVE'])
- `project_employee_assignments` (id, tenant_id, project_id REFERENCES projects(id), employee_id REFERENCES employees(id), assigned_role_in_project, allocation_percentage, start_date, end_date NULLABLE, status ['ACTIVE'|'INACTIVE'])
- `work_shifts` (id, tenant_id, shift_name, start_time, end_time, shift_allowance_amount)
- `employee_rosters` (id, tenant_id, employee_id, project_id, shift_id, roster_date, status ['SCHEDULED'|'PRESENT'|'ABSENT'|'LEAVE'|'SICK'])
- `hr_requests` (id, tenant_id, employee_id, project_id NULLABLE, request_type ['OVERTIME'|'LEAVE'|'SICK'], start_date, end_date, hours_requested, reason, attachment_url NULLABLE, status, current_approval_step)
- `hr_approval_logs` (id, tenant_id, hr_request_id, step_order, approver_employee_id, action, comments, processed_at)
- `pm_handovers` (id, tenant_id, project_id, from_pm_id REFERENCES employees(id), to_pm_id REFERENCES employees(id), reason, effective_date, status ['PENDING'|'APPROVED'|'REJECTED'], om_approval_status, hm_approval_status)
- `tasks` (id, tenant_id, project_id, assigned_to_employee_id, title, status, priority)
- `timesheets` (id, tenant_id, task_id, employee_id, hours_spent, date)
- `project_budgets` (id, tenant_id, project_id, category, allocated_amount, spent_amount, alert_threshold_percentage)
- `project_expenses` (id, tenant_id, project_id, requested_by_employee_id REFERENCES employees(id), amount, description, status, current_approval_step, required_final_step, finance_approval_status)
- `cash_advances` (id, tenant_id, project_id, requested_by_employee_id REFERENCES employees(id), amount_requested, amount_disbursed, purpose, status ['PENDING_APPROVAL'|'DISBURSED'|'SETTLEMENT_PENDING'|'SETTLED'|'REJECTED'], current_approval_step, required_final_step, finance_approval_status)
- `cash_advance_settlements` (id, tenant_id, cash_advance_id REFERENCES cash_advances(id), actual_amount_spent, balance_difference, refund_or_reimbursement_status, receipt_urls TEXT[], verified_by_finance_id REFERENCES employees(id), status)
- `petty_cash_funds` (id, tenant_id, project_id NULLABLE, fund_name, custodian_employee_id REFERENCES employees(id), max_limit_amount, current_balance, min_threshold_amount, status)
- `petty_cash_vouchers` (id, tenant_id, fund_id REFERENCES petty_cash_funds(id), requested_by_employee_id REFERENCES employees(id), amount, description, receipt_url, status ['PENDING'|'PAID_BY_CUSTODIAN'|'REJECTED'])
- `petty_cash_replenishments` (id, tenant_id, fund_id REFERENCES petty_cash_funds(id), requested_by_custodian_id REFERENCES employees(id), total_claimed_amount, status ['PENDING_FINANCE'|'APPROVED_AND_TOPPED_UP'|'REJECTED'], verified_by_finance_id REFERENCES employees(id))
- `approval_workflows` (id, tenant_id, module ['EXPENSE'|'CASH_ADVANCE'|'PETTY_CASH_REFILL'|'HR_REQUEST'|'PM_HANDOVER'], min_amount, max_amount, required_steps_count)
- `approval_steps` (id, tenant_id, workflow_id, step_order [1..5], approver_role)
- `expense_approval_logs` (id, tenant_id, expense_id NULLABLE, cash_advance_id NULLABLE, petty_cash_refill_id NULLABLE, step_order, approver_employee_id, action, comments, processed_at)
- `ai_insights` (id, tenant_id, target_type, insight_text, risk_score)

# 14. WORKFLOW INSTRUCTIONS FOR CURSOR AGENT
Ketika diminta membangun fitur apa pun di aplikasi ini:
1. Selalu terapkan isolasi `tenant_id` dan RLS Supabase pada setiap query.
2. Pastikan pengecekan assignment aktif sebelum memberikan hak akses interaksi proyek kepada PM maupun Employee.
3. Buat UI menggunakan komponen Shadcn UI + Tailwind CSS yang bersih, responsif, dan mudah dipahami oleh pengguna di tiap tingkatan hirarki.
